       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-VISCO-CLAY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-VISCO-CLAY-PROOFS.
           05  WS-STRESS-STRAIN-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LIMIT-CYCLE-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ADHESION-OK              PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RHEOLOGY-LATENCY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RHEOLOGY-SEAL-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-VISCO-CLAY-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PVH-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PVH-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-STRESS-AND-CYCLE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-ADHESION-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PVH-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-STRESS-AND-CYCLE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-STRESS-STRAIN-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LIMIT-CYCLE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-ADHESION-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ADHESION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RHEOLOGY-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PVH-PROOFS.
           IF WS-STRESS-STRAIN-OK = 1 AND
              WS-LIMIT-CYCLE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ADHESION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-RHEOLOGY-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-RHEOLOGY-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PVH-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PVH-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PVH-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PVH-CODE.
